{"id":"n75408-1-8","stage":4,"title":"조의금 · 赙金","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75408-1-8-1","ko":"부장님 아버님께서 돌아가셨다는군요.","zh":"听说部长的父亲去世了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"부장님","meaning":"部长","explanation":"부장：部长；님：尊称后缀。","readings":[{"term":"부장","audio":"/audio/01b3143b5583938853b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59737","senseId":"1","lemma":"부장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아버님께서","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버님：父亲，爸爸；께서：이/가 的敬语形式，标记受到尊敬的主语。","readings":[{"term":"아버님","audio":"/audio/64187c187ea07eb8ba99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71340","senseId":"2","lemma":"아버님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돌아가셨다는군요.","meaning":"去世，逝世","explanation":"돌아가다：去世，逝世；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다는군요：转述听到的陈述并表示新得知：“听说……啊”。","readings":[{"term":"돌아가다","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74103","senseId":"7","lemma":"돌아가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"01b3143b55839388","term":"부장","zh":"部长","audio":"/audio/01b3143b5583938853b4.mp3","entryId":"59737","definition":"在机关、组织中负责管理一个部门的职位；或指在这个职位的人。","pronunciation":["부장"]},{"id":"64187c187ea07eb8","term":"아버님","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/64187c187ea07eb8ba99.mp3","entryId":"71340","definition":"(尊称)在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的男子。","pronunciation":["아버님"]},{"id":"1152d7a56fb1600a","term":"돌아가다","zh":"去世，逝世","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3","entryId":"74103","definition":"(尊称)死去。","pronunciation":["도라가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2ec977cbf80d9bd1609d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n75408-1-8-2","ko":"저런, 일단 조의금은 각자 내는 것으로 하는 것이 좋겠죠?","zh":"哎呀，那咱们最好还是各自出份慰问金吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저런,","meaning":"啊，哎呀","explanation":"저런：啊，哎呀","readings":[{"term":"저런","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71224","senseId":"1","lemma":"저런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일단","meaning":"暂时","explanation":"일단：暂时","readings":[{"term":"일단","audio":"/audio/47a337529350ca3ed26b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25132","senseId":"2","lemma":"일단","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조의금은","meaning":"赙金","explanation":"조의금：赙金；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"조의금","audio":"/audio/d847a01856e55d2fbc7d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75408","senseId":"1","lemma":"조의금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"각자","meaning":"各自，自己","explanation":"각자：各自，自己","readings":[{"term":"각자","audio":"/audio/feec8d12b801f3820718.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16207","senseId":"1","lemma":"각자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내는","meaning":"交，提，提交","explanation":"내다：交，提，提交；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"내다","audio":"/audio/3c7ab23f77767092623c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89906","senseId":"17","lemma":"내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것으로","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는","meaning":"办理，处置，分配","explanation":"하다：办理，处置，分配；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"13","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것이","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋겠죠?","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2f66dcda6095507e","term":"저런","zh":"啊，哎呀","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3","entryId":"71224","definition":"听到没料到的、惊奇或可惜的事情时说的词语。","pronunciation":["저런"]},{"id":"47a337529350ca3e","term":"일단","zh":"暂时","audio":"/audio/47a337529350ca3ed26b.mp3","entryId":"25132","definition":"先在短时间内。","pronunciation":["일딴"]},{"id":"d847a01856e55d2f","term":"조의금","zh":"赙金","audio":"/audio/d847a01856e55d2fbc7d.mp3","entryId":"75408","definition":"为表达哀伤他人死亡之意而捐献的钱。","pronunciation":["조ː의금","조ː이금"]},{"id":"feec8d12b801f382","term":"각자","zh":"各自，自己","audio":"/audio/feec8d12b801f3820718.mp3","entryId":"16207","definition":"每个人分别。","pronunciation":["각짜"]},{"id":"3c7ab23f77767092","term":"내다","zh":"交，提，提交","audio":"/audio/3c7ab23f77767092623c.mp3","entryId":"89906","definition":"交出或献上钱或物品等。","pronunciation":["내ː다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"办理，处置，分配","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"处理事情或问题。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/3785c4a0562a26924fe3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.949,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=75408","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":141,"sequenceScore":2.7757,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["哎呀，那咱们最好还是各自出份慰问金吧？","听说部长的父亲去世了啊。","发生什么事了？看起来你非常辛苦啊。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说部长的父亲去世了啊。","发生什么事了？看起来你非常辛苦啊。","哎呀，那咱们最好还是各自出份慰问金吧？"],"answer":2}]}
